From 2222222222222222222222222222222222222222 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luke <luke@localhost>
Date: Mon, 3 Nov 2026 18:10:00 +0000
Subject: halium.config: build BT as modules to match GKI module_outs

Standalone replacement for the config part of 0014 (dropped in this
experiment because it edits AppArmor lines that don't exist without the
AppArmor patches).
---
 arch/arm64/configs/halium.config | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/halium.config b/arch/arm64/configs/halium.config
index 31ce547e..aaaaaaaaaa 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/halium.config
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/halium.config
@@ -6,11 +6,11 @@
-# bluebinder
-CONFIG_BT=y
-CONFIG_BT_RFCOMM=y
-CONFIG_BT_HIDP=y
-CONFIG_BT_HCIVHCI=y
-CONFIG_RFKILL=y
+# bluebinder - keep as modules to match GKI module_outs list
+CONFIG_BT=m
+CONFIG_BT_RFCOMM=m
+CONFIG_BT_HIDP=m
+CONFIG_RFKILL=m
 # Do not enforce kernel modules signature
 # CONFIG_MODULE_SIG_FORCE is not set
 # CONFIG_MODULE_SIG_PROTECT is not set
